    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837700/extras/b91919d2b5a362b105d1bddbb38d2265.poster.avif?t=1736957685\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837700/extras/b91919d2b5a362b105d1bddbb38d2265.webm?t=1736957685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837700/extras/b91919d2b5a362b105d1bddbb38d2265.mp4?t=1736957685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You are a traveling businessman with an affinity for coffee. You travel to Jade City for a meeting but first check out a local coffee shop: Cafe Estro. Inside you meet a lovely barista named Hazel. The two have an instant connection but you can't help but wonder why such a good coffee shop has so few customers.<br>You and Hazel grow close and you discover that this girl is actually... a femboy?<br><br>Hazelnut Latte is about helping out a struggling cafe while discovering things about yourself and forming relationships in Jade City. Gender lines will be blurred and crossed in Jade City.<br><br><strong>Features: </strong><br><i>Romance femboys and other cuties that blur gender norms!<br>Choices matter and will offer different events depending on what you do!<br>Help build back up a struggling business and manage your own cafe!</i>",
